    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Prohibit";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibits the action of obtaining or retaining business or a business or personal advantage with the intention of improperly influencing a foreign public official.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The person does so with the intention of improperly influencing a foreign public official (who may be the other person) in order to obtain or retain business or a business or personal advantage (whether or not for the first-mentioned person).";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The person commits an offence.";
